<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Your {{rma.kind}} {{rma.reference}} is approved</title></head>
<body style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.5;">
  <p>Hello {{customer.givenName}},</p>
  <p>We've approved your {{rma.kind}} <strong>{{rma.reference}}</strong> for {{units}} from Order
    {{order.reference}}.</p>
  {{#returnAddress}}
  <p>Send it to:</p>
  <address style="font-style: normal; margin: 0 0 1em 1em;">
    {{name}}<br>
    {{street}}<br>
    {{postcode}} {{city}}<br>
    {{country}}
  </address>
  {{/returnAddress}}
  {{^returnAddress}}
  <p>Your RMA's page in your account shows where to send it.</p>
  {{/returnAddress}}
  <p>Write <strong>{{rma.reference}}</strong> on the parcel, so we know what it is.{{#sendBackBy}}
    It must reach us by <strong>{{.}}</strong>, or the {{rma.kind}} expires.{{/sendBackBy}}</p>
  <p>Ecomm</p>
</body>
</html>
